  "details": "The \"Interact Passthrough\" setting on the VRCSceneDescriptor losts its settings in some cases.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n- Add some custom layers\n\n- Select one or more of them in the Interact Passthrough setting\n\n- Save\n\n- Enter play mode\n\n- Interact Passthrough losts the changes made (also after exit play mode)\n\nIf the world will be builded instead of enter play mode, the setting keeps stored.",
